  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5d9f1182fc3e41e8a2ae214deeea00d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Abysses.Level.PuzzleObjective
  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  floor: 2
  quadrant: 0
  label: Cadenas morse ORANGE
  labelEnglish: Morse lock ORANGE
  hints:
  - "Une balise clignote dehors, de l'autre c\xF4t\xE9 d'un hublot. Le haut-parleur
    pr\xE8s du cadenas bipe en m\xEAme temps."
  - "C'est du morse : chaque chiffre fait 5 signaux courts (\xB7) ou longs (\u2014).
    La table est fix\xE9e au mur, \xE0 c\xF4t\xE9 du cadenas."
  - "Le message fait 3 chiffres et se r\xE9p\xE8te apr\xE8s un long silence. R\xE8gle
    les 3 molettes dans l'ordre, puis VALIDER."
  hintsEnglish:
  - A beacon is flashing outside, beyond one of the windows. The speaker next to
    the lock beeps along.
  - "It is Morse code: each digit is 5 short (\xB7) or long (\u2014) signals. The
    table is on the wall, next to the lock."
  - The message has 3 digits and repeats after a long silence. Set the 3 wheels in
    order, then press CONFIRM.
